This is Young Dadi's official YouTube channel.

Young Dadi is a North Macedonian rising star known for his unique style, inspired by a variety of genres, as well as for his experimental nature.

The musician's career took off in 2019 with his debut single Pina Colada. He has since expanded his discography which now includes several singles and two EPs - one of them being the May 2023 release Scorpius Ch.1.

Along with his personal work, Young Dadi has also collaborated with numerous artists such as Bon Praskiza, Matej Foltz, Dnk and Sexy Marsa. 

